# Kelkoo daily conversion postbacks (probe per geo → process ready → hourly retry).
# Copy to crontab on the server if Flask/Gunicorn is not running 24/7.
#
# Default in-app schedule: 08:00 Asia/Jerusalem (KELKOO_DAILY_POSTBACK_SCHEDULER_*).
# Retries for missing countries are scheduled in-process (+1h, up to MAX_ATTEMPTS).
# Run log: data/kelkoo_daily_postbacks_run_log.json
#
# 0 8 * * * cd /path/to/KLblend && /usr/bin/python3 cli/run_kelkoo_daily_postbacks_scheduled.py >> runtime/logs/kelkoo_daily_postbacks.log 2>&1
